# Chocobo's Wounds (jeuno 4) with its era module, GM-set accepted with Timer far above any Vana'diel day (an epoch time,
# as a server leaves it that turns era mode on mid-quest): the module's onTrade takes the Timer > VanadielUniqueDay()
# side of its >=, 73, where only equality (#era) and less-than reach the other arms. Nothing is taken or written.
module modules/era/lua/quests/jeuno/chocobos_wounds.lua
lists UpperJeuno/Chocobo/onTrade
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 lvl=20
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_SOA 0
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds accepted
charvar Quest[3][4]Timer 1800000045
item ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x2
login
walk -59.8,8.2,92.9                                 # beside the Chocobo: a trade does not walk
trade Chocobo ClumpOfGausebitWildgrass x1               # Timer 1800000045 > today (8000): 73
finish
